    "blurb": "Open source System-1 decisions, mapped into processes",
    "overview": "Replace an LLM-in-the-loop decision with a fast, typed decision from the open source Laya engine. Select a pre-approved decision pack and write choice/score/yes-no answers straight to process variables. No model key is needed. The connector talks to a self-hosted Laya server.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Get typed AI decisions from Laya in Camunda",
    "splashDescription": "This connector runs Laya, the open source System-1 (trained, non-autoregressive) decision engine, from Camunda as a native outbound connector. Select a pre-approved decision pack, and the typed answers (choice/score/yes-no) are mapped back into your process. Only pre-registered decision packs can be referenced, so a process can never submit arbitrary question sets or credentials.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/873541/overview/img3760282481484765076.png?335506bf5b0dbaa0d1e35c26a6cabf8e",
